---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Mahe Mishra.">
  <section class="section first">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="ref">ABT</span>
        <h2>About</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I am {profile.name}, a programme support and delivery professional working in NHS
          capital projects. Right now that means the {profile.programme}, a £1B+
          redevelopment delivered under an NEC contract, where I sit inside the
          programme team handling governance, reporting and the connective work
          between Finance, Communications, Design and Construction, and
          Mobilisation.
        </p>
        <p>
          My background is a 2:1 degree in Business Management and
          Economics from the University of Sheffield, and my working style is
          shaped by data. I build in Python, SQL and Power BI, and my default
          instinct on any process is to ask whether a machine should be doing
          the boring half of it. In my previous role that instinct removed a
          quarter to a third of the time spent on routine reporting.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am currently working towards the APM Project Management
          Qualification. Longer term I am interested in major infrastructure
          delivery, the kind of programmes measured in years and billions,
          where good governance and honest reporting are the difference between
          delivery and drift.
        </p>
        <p>
          Away from work, I cook, Indian, Italian, South-East Asian dishes, play 
          lots of video games - RDR2 being my favourite, going out with my 
          friends and intense workouts in the gym.
        </p>
        <p>
          The fastest way to reach me is
          <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .first {
    border-top: 0;
  }
</style>
